    {
      "id": "p0263-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Although I was only on the sidelines during most of Underta/e's English-to Japanese localization, watching everything come together was an enlightening experience for me. I learned just as much while writing this book too.",
        "raw": "Although I was only on the sidelines during most of Underta/e's English-to\nJapanese localization, watching everything come together was an enlightening\nexperience for me. I learned just as much while writing this book too.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0980214,
          0.09063571,
          0.70142731,
          0.1392
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09599386,
          0.08992143,
          0.70915223,
          0.14027143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          2,
          3,
          4
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "《Undertale》从英文译成日文的过程中，我多数时候只是旁观者，但亲眼看着一切逐渐成形，仍让我大受启发。写这本书时，我也学到了同样多的东西。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
