    {
      "id": "p0263-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "My biggest challenge was finding a way to explain Underta/e's English-to Japanese translation for readers who know nothing about Undertale, video games, translation, the Japanese language, or Japanese culture. Packaging all of these complex topics in a clear, understandable way took so long that I basically ended up rewriting this book twice over the course of several years.",
        "raw": "My biggest challenge was finding a way to explain Underta/e's English-to\nJapanese translation for readers who know nothing about Undertale, video\ngames, translation, the Japanese language, or Japanese culture. Packaging\nall of these complex topics in a clear, understandable way took so long that I\nbasically ended up rewriting this book twice over the course of several years.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09892365,
          0.15467857,
          0.68860312,
          0.24065
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09599386,
          0.15396429,
          0.70915223,
          0.24172143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
