    {
      "id": "p0263-b005",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "I also had to devise my own writing style guide, which I'll call the \"Legends of Localization Style\", or \"LoL Style\" for short. You basically ignore other style guides and just do whatever makes the most sense for your situation - but try to remain consistent throughout.",
        "raw": "I also had to devise my own writing style guide, which I'll call the \"Legends\nof Localization Style\", or \"LoL Style\" for short. You basically ignore other\nstyle guides and just do whatever makes the most sense for your situation -\nbut try to remain consistent throughout.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
