    {
      "id": "p0263-b008",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "Think of localization as redrawing an existing painting, but with different tools - it's like if you tried to redraw the Mona Lisa with crayons or markers instead of paint. You could do a really good job, but it's still going to be different in the end, no matter what",
        "raw": "Think of localization as redrawing an existing painting, but with different\ntools - it's like if you tried to redraw the Mona Lisa with crayons or\nmarkers instead of paint. You could do a really good job, but it's still going\nto be different in the end, no matter what",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.1447866,
          0.52105,
          0.70760117,
          0.5895
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.10798676,
          0.52033571,
          0.70891907,
          0.59057143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          21,
          22,
          23,
          24
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "• 可以把本地化想成换一种工具重画现有的画。比如不用颜料，而用蜡笔或马克笔重画《蒙娜丽莎》。你可能画得非常好，但无论如何，最终都不会一模一样。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
