    {
      "id": "p0263-b009",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because most localization choices are essentially personal choices, and because different target audiences usually have different expectations, it's probably not possible for a \"perfect, universal localization\" to exist",
        "raw": "Because most localization choices are essentially personal choices, and\nbecause different target audiences usually have different expectations, it's\nprobably not possible for a \"perfect, universal localization\" to exist",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.14485756,
          0.60395,
          0.70862507,
          0.65285
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.10805772,
          0.60323571,
          0.70994297,
          0.65392143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          25,
          26,
          27
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "• 大多数本地化选择说到底是个人选择，不同目标受众的期待通常也不同，因此“完美、放之四海而皆准的本地化”大概并不存在。",
        "status": "draft",
