    {
      "id": "p0263-b010",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "I've only covered a hundred or so Undertale localization changes in this book, but there were actually thousands of other, smaller localization issues that had to be solved. Had I covered every localization issue at my usual level of detail, this book would be about 18,000 pages long and weigh approximately 128 pounds (56 kilograms)",
        "raw": "I've only covered a hundred or so Undertale localization changes in this\nbook, but there were actually thousands of other, smaller localization\nissues that had to be solved. Had I covered every localization issue at\nmy usual level of detail, this book would be about 18,000 pages long and\nweigh approximately 128 pounds (56 kilograms)",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
